SM-T715 tablet: the app drawer opens without an icon rescan or the keyboard.

Each opening ran AppLibrary.refreshIcons(): two `find` passes over every
icon directory, parsed line by line in QML, then an iconIndex swap that
re-resolves every icon. The image's icons never change after the build,
and the start-up scan and the debounced rescan on app-list changes stay.
Each opening also focused the search field, which unfolded the on-screen
keyboard; it now takes focus when tapped, as Android's drawer does.
Measured on the tablet (5 openings, means): quickshell 1336 -> 660 ms CPU
and 1115 -> 748 ms GPU, Hyprland 429 -> 299 ms GPU, and no keyboard layer
(sm-t715-omarchy docs/ONDEVICE-2026-10-29.md). Against omarchy-mobile
5f7ba48, packages/omamobile-shell (applied with patch -p1 in that
directory, after 0001 and 0002).

